 Locate `results.json` under `playwright-report/`, then run the bundled, standard-library-only reader. Resolve `<skill-dir>` as the directory containing this SKILL.md:
 
+Run it as one command with literal absolute paths and no shell variables, `$()`, or `cd`, so an exact-command approval can match it. Use the project's known absolute root (the working directory) for `<absolute-project-root>`:
+
 ```bash
